<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept importance="optional" id="t00394">
	<title>Idle Stop and Go (ISG)</title>
	<shortdesc>Idle Stop &amp; Go (ISG) system helps reduce fuel consumption by automatically stopping and restarting the engine. The engine restarts automatically when the required conditions are met.</shortdesc>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>idle stop and go (ISG) system</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<section id="e02625">
			<title>ISG indicator</title>
			<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e02626">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
					<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="1">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e02627">
									<image href="images/OMQ4A045032.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2"/>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>The <uicontrol>AUTO STOP</uicontrol> indicator (<image href="images/WKIA_075.jpg" scale="15" align="center" placement="inline"/>) appears on the instrument cluster.</p>
		</section>
		<section id="e02628">
			<title>Activating ISG</title>
			<p>The ISG system turns on whenever you turn the vehicle on.</p>
			<note type="note" id="e02629">
				<p>When the engine restarts automatically by the ISG system, some warning lights (ABS, ESC, <term translate="no">ESC OFF</term>, EPS, or parking brake) may appear for a few seconds. This occurs due to low battery voltage and does not indicate a system malfunction.</p>
			</note>
		</section>
		<section id="e02630">
			<title>Deactivating ISG</title>
			<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e02631">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
					<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="1">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e02632">
									<image href="images/N_SP327_C08_001_1_E.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2"/>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<ul id="e02633">
				<li>
					<p>To deactivate ISG, press the ISG <term translate="no">OFF</term> button. The light on the button illuminates.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>To activate ISG, press the ISG <term translate="no">OFF</term> button again. The light on the button disappears.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
	</conbody>
